{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "node.ad3ed6f7c586444ec7213491 adds nav > 0 to Fund scope without source support; this also blocks an applicable SFC designation when NAV is nonpositive or unknown.",
    "All candidates leave the SFC's holistic assessment and non-exhaustive designation factors outside executable logic; accepting an actual designation preserves its classification effect but does not implement the assessment requirements.",
    "The source does not specify an exposure measurement date, methodology or treatment of temporary crossings; supplied assessment-time facts must not silently resolve these legal uncertainties.",
    "A FALSE result should mean neither represented classification trigger is established as applicable, not a general certification of non-complex status under other instruments.",
    "The candidates' global conflict-blocking policy is an implementation safeguard, not a source requirement, and can prevent an otherwise established mandatory threshold from producing TRUE."
  ],
